<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Elandsrand Sept qtr available profit rises.</title>
<headline>Elandsrand Sept qtr available profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Available profit		 39.1   vs 32.8</p>
<p>    Capital spending		 25.7   vs 21.4</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		   527,000 vs 543,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		  4,209 vs   3,973</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		     7.99 vs 7.32</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)		   35,416 vs 36,148</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		54,863 vs 53,025</p>
<p>Full name: Elandsrand Gold Mining Co Ltd, managed by Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
